  urldate = {2025-05-25},
  abstract = {The Monte Carlo method is applied to the problem of radiant heat transfer to a nonisothermal absorbing and emitting gray gas between gray walls. The solutions are compared to limiting cases of black walls and large optical thickness available in the literature. The Monte Carlo procedure was found to be simply and quickly formulated for complex cases which cannot be readily attacked by standard analytical techniques. The numerical results were quickly obtained with the use of a high speed electronic computer. This method also gives greater physical insight into the behavior of the system.},
  langid = {english},
  annotation = {abstractTranslation: 将蒙特卡洛方法应用于灰壁间非等温吸收和发射灰色气体的辐射传热问题。将这些解决方案与文献中可用的黑壁和大光学厚度的极限情况进行了比较。蒙特卡洛程序被发现是简单和快速的公式化复杂的情况下，不能轻易攻击的标准分析技术。利用高速电子计算机快速获得了数值结果。该方法还提供了对系统行为的更深入的物理见解。},
  file = {C:\Users\EricPu\Zotero\storage\I8DKMLHT\Howell和Perlmutter - 1964 - Monte carlo solution of thermal transfer through radiant media between gray walls.pdf}
}

